# TCG Storefront Integration: One Piece & Lorcana

Successfully integrated Disney Lorcana and One Piece TCG as major categories in the Coolex Shop, maintaining full UI consistency and cart functionality.

## ✨ Key Features Implemented

### 1. One Piece TCG Integration
- **Direct Data Sync**: Implemented a high-speed local JSON sync for One Piece, importing all sets and cards from [onepiece_cards.json](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/data/onepiece_cards.json).
- **Premium Storefront**: Created a dedicated One Piece index, set, and card views. The design includes specialized stats like Power, Cost, and Counter, styled to match the premium Pokémon/Lorcana look.
- **Admin Inventory**: Added a One Piece section to the Admin Dashboard allowing for manual pricing and stock management via AJAX.
- **Cart & Checkout**: One Piece cards now correctly map to the cart system, enabling full checkout flow.

### 2. Disney Lorcana Integration
- **Local JSON Sync**: Processed over 1,000 cards from [lorcana.json](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/data/lorcana.json).
- **UI Mirroring**: Ensured the Lorcana set view perfectly mirrors Pokémon and MTG designs (3-column grid, breadcrumbs, etc.).
- **Inventory Control**: Implemented AJAX-based pricing and stock management for Lorcana cards.

### 3. Order Management System (New!)
- **Admin Order Tracking**: Added a central "Manage Orders" dashboard to see every customer checkout, including their name, email, and shipping address.
- **Multi-TCG Fulfillment**: The checkout system now intelligently deducts stock from the correct category table (Pokémon, MTG, Lorcana, or One Piece).
- **Status Manipulation**: Admins can now mark orders as "Pending", "Shipped", or "Cancelled" with a single click.

### 4. Premium Admin Sidebar UI
- **Modern 2-Column Layout**: Transformed the admin panel from a simple list of buttons into a professional dashboard with a fixed vertical sidebar.
- **Quick Stats**: Added a dashboard summary showing Total Sales, Orders, and Customers with visual growth indicators.
- **TCG Segmentation**: Unified the management of Pokémon, Magic, Lorcana, and One Piece under a single, cohesive navigation bar.

## 🛠️ Components Created/Updated

- **One Piece**: [OnePiece_Import.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/OnePiece_Import.php), [OnePiece_model.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/OnePiece_model.php), [onepiece_index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/onepiece_index.php), [view_onepiece_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_onepiece_set.php), [view_onepiece_card.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_onepiece_card.php), [onepiece_inventory.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/admin/onepiece_inventory.php)
- **Lorcana**: [Lorcana_Import.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Lorcana_Import.php), [Lorcana_model.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Lorcana_model.php), [lorcana_index.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/lorcana_index.php), [view_lorcana_set.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_lorcana_set.php), [view_lorcana_card.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/store/view_lorcana_card.php), [lorcana_inventory.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/admin/lorcana_inventory.php)
- **Shared**: [Store.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Store.php), [Admin.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Admin.php), [Cart.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Cart.php), [megamenu.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/templates/megamenu.php)

## 🚀 How to Verify (One Piece)
1. **Admin Home**: Visit the new [Admin Dashboard](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/admin/index.php) to see the sidebar and stats.
2. **Orders**: Go to **Manage Orders** to see the clean table layout.
3. **Sync card**: Check any **Inventory** page (e.g., Pokémon) to see the new card-based control panel.

